"<header class=\"topbar\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <a class=\"wordmark\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Lotolipi home\">lotolipi<span>.</span></a>\n      <nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><a href=\"/#case-studies\">Case studies</a><a href=\"/lottolov\">Lottolov</a><a href=\"/resume\">Résumé</a><a href=\"/#contact\">Contact</a><a href=\"/lo-lab\">Lo Lab</a></nav>\n    </div>\n  </header><main id=\"main-content\"><section class=\"hero wrap\"><p class=\"label\"><a href=\"/#case-studies\">Case studies</a> / Decision support</p><h1>Signal<span>.</span></h1><p class=\"hero-intro\">Should NOVA pilot a premium beverage? I designed a workspace that lets a decision-maker follow a claim back to its source and see how a change in sales volume affects the recommendation.</p><a class=\"hero-link\" href=\"/signal\">Try the prototype →</a></section><section class=\"work\"><div class=\"wrap\"><header class=\"work-head\"><p class=\"label\">Independent prototype · Synthetic research</p><h2>Two numbers, two questions.</h2><p>67.2% of respondents aged 18–34 expressed concept interest. A separate sample returned a 24% positive response at ₹99. The studies cannot tell us how that age group would respond at that price.</p></header><figure><img src=\"/assets/signal-brief.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:650px;object-fit:cover;object-position:top\" alt=\"Decision Brief with source-linked concept interest and price response\"></figure><div class=\"walkthrough-copy\"><h3>Keep the interpretation with the evidence.</h3><p>In Evidence Room, the reader can inspect both samples, open the source rows and compare the records. Reconcile lets them save “Context differs” with a rationale and the evidence versions behind it.</p><h3>Make the decision testable.</h3><p>In Alternatives, reducing pilot volume from 250,000 to 200,000 units moves the model from ₹5 lakh profit to ₹2 lakh loss. A reviewer can revise that assumption and return to the original reading.</p><h3>What I verified</h3><p>Desktop and mobile browser tests covered source inspection, saving a rationale, changing the forecast and retrieving saved work after reload. These results describe prototype behaviour. The business figures are synthetic.</p><a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"/signal\">Explore Signal →</a></div></div></section><section class=\"wrap social-context\"><h2>Beyond the case study.</h2><a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lotologique/\">Product logic and design findings · @lotologique ↗</a></section><section class=\"wrap social-context\"><p>Design context: connectivity differs across populations. Explore the <a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"/lo-lab\">global connectivity data experiment</a>. It is not evidence about this prototype’s users.</p></section></main><footer class=\"footer\" id=\"contact\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <h2>Say <em>hello.</em></h2><p>Have a product role in mind? I’d love to hear what your team is building.</p>\n      <a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"mailto:smshilpi1@gmail.com\">smshilpi1@gmail.com <svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#f7-envelope\"></use></svg></a>\n      <p class=\"closing-label\">Find me elsewhere</p><nav class=\"social-identities\" aria-label=\"Instagram profiles\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lotologique/\"><span>Product logic</span><strong>@lotologique ↗</strong><small>Design findings, mini case studies and experiments.</small></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lottolov/\"><span>Art & illustration</span><strong>@lottolov ↗</strong><small>Visual explorations, prints and everything art.</small></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lotolipi/\"><span>Personal</span><strong>@lotolipi ↗</strong><small>Life beyond the work.</small></a></nav><div class=\"footer-end\">\n        <span>© 2026 Shilpi Mishra · Lotolipi</span><a href=\"/ip\">Intellectual property</a><a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy</a>\n        <a class=\"back-top\" href=\"#top\">Back to top <svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#f7-arrow_up\"></use></svg></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer><style>#contact.footer{padding-block:clamp(64px,10vw,144px) 48px}#contact.footer>.wrap{text-align:center}#contact.footer h2{font-size:clamp(56px,12vw,144px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:0 0 24px}#contact.footer>.wrap>p:not(.closing-label){max-width:38ch;margin:0 auto 24px;line-height:1.6}#contact.footer .closing-label{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.08em;margin:64px 0 16px}#contact.footer .social-identities{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;background:transparent!important;padding:0!important;border:0!important;margin:0 auto 48px}#contact.footer .social-identities>a{display:flex!important;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center!important;gap:10px;padding:28px 20px!important;border:1px solid currentColor!important;border-radius:18px;text-decoration:none!important;background:transparent!important;min-width:0}#contact.footer .social-identities>a>*{text-align:center!important;text-decoration:none!important;margin:0!important}#contact.footer .social-identities strong{font-size:clamp(18px,2.5vw,28px);line-height:1.2}#contact.footer .social-identities small{font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}#contact.footer .social-identities>a:hover strong{text-decoration:underline!important}#contact.footer .footer-end{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:16px 24px;padding-top:28px;font-size:13px;text-align:center}#contact.footer .footer-end>*{font-size:13px!important}#contact.footer .footer-end>span{flex-basis:100%}#contact.footer .back-top{margin:0!important}@media(max-width:47rem){#contact.footer .social-identities{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}#contact.footer .social-identities>a{padding:24px!important}#contact.footer .closing-label{margin-top:48px}#contact.footer .footer-end{gap:16px}#contact.footer .back-top{flex-basis:10